## 💻 Usage

```python
import joblib
import pandas as pd

# Load trained model
model = joblib.load('player_overall_model.pkl')

# Prepare player data
player_data = pd.DataFrame({
    'Age': [28],
    'Potential': [88],
    'Value': [75000000],
    'Wage': [350000],
    'Special': [85],
    'International Reputation': [4],
    'Skill Moves': [5],
    'Height': [185],
    'Weight': [78],
    'Crossing': [85],
    'Finishing': [87],
    'SprintSpeed': [89]
    # Add other features as needed
})

# Make prediction
predicted_rating = model.predict(player_data)
print(f"Predicted Overall Rating: {predicted_rating[0]:.1f}")
```

